sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant ReactApp
    participant AuthAPI
    participant Database

    User->>ReactApp: Submit email and password
    ReactApp->>AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/login
    AuthAPI->>Database: Find user by email
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: Verify password hash
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: Generate JWT token
    AuthAPI->>Database: Store refresh token
    AuthAPI-->>ReactApp: 200 token and role
    ReactApp->>ReactApp: Resolve RBAC navigation
    ReactApp-->>User: Redirect role dashboard
